The sentences in this folder, with their words, readings and word-by-word English gloss,
come from the Hambaanglaang 冚唪唥粵文讀本 graded readers and are licensed under Creative
Commons Attribution 4.0 International (CC BY 4.0): https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/

Source: https://github.com/hblhk/stories and https://hambaanglaang.hk. Each line names its
story in `title`, the story's page in `url`, and the story's author in `author` where the
readers list one.

Each line's second `english` entry, `"by": "machine"`, is a machine translation of the whole
sentence added by this repository, and is covered by its license, CC BY-SA 4.0
(../../LICENSE). The word-by-word gloss (`"by": "word by word"`) stays the readers'.

Changes: the top-level `jyutping` of each line has the sentence's punctuation copied in
between the source's syllables; readings may have been corrected in this repository, and each
line's git history shows what changed. See ../README.md, "Changes made here".
